# Communication / Voice AI / WhatsApp / Email Automation flags (Phase 7).
# Email Automation + AI Workspace default ON. Voice AI + WhatsApp UI default OFF (hidden; re-enable via =true).
# Docs: apps/web/src/features/communication/feature-flags/COMMUNICATION_FLAGS.md
